OL,3,ABollywood actor Tiger Shroff survives
OL,4,Ashooting in Mumbai
OL,5,
OL,6,FBollywood actor Tiger Shroff has
OL,7,Fsurvived a shooting in Mumbai and has
OL,8,Fnot sustained any gunshot wounds,
OL,9,Faccording to Indian police who are
OL,10,Finvestigating the incident.
OL,12,FThe 36-year-old was shot at on Sunday
OL,13,Fevening, while he was in a car that was
OL,14,Fleaving a football club in the suburb
OL,15,Fof Juhu.
OL,17,FSeveral news outlets have published a
OL,18,Fvideo showing at least two gunmen
OL,19,Ffiring multiple shots at close range at
OL,20,Fthe front passenger seat of a car while
OL,21,Fit is slowly moving past a crowd.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
