OL,3,ABollywood actor Tiger Shroff survives
OL,4,Ashooting in Mumbai
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident has heightened concern
OL,7,Fabout the safety of public figures in
OL,8,FIndia, with some killed or injured in
OL,9,Ftargeted attacks in recent years.
